414
00:19:09,160 --> 00:19:13,829
Well, uh, maybe in a few months, after it's not so fresh,
/wˈɛl ˈʌ mˈe‍ɪbiː ɪn ɐ fjˈuː mˈʌnθs ˈæftɚɹ ɪts nˌɑːt sˌo‍ʊ fɹˈɛʃ/

415
00:19:13,904 --> 00:19:17,844
we could all, uh, you know, get a beer.
